// Not bound (see README.md):
//   TraceLog: variadic
//   SetTraceLogCallback: takes a C callback (TraceLogCallback)
//   SetLoadFileDataCallback: takes a C callback (LoadFileDataCallback)
//   SetSaveFileDataCallback: takes a C callback (SaveFileDataCallback)
//   SetLoadFileTextCallback: takes a C callback (LoadFileTextCallback)
//   SetSaveFileTextCallback: takes a C callback (SaveFileTextCallback)
//   GetFileModTime: returns long, which differs between platforms
//   TextFormat: variadic
//   SetAudioStreamCallback: takes a C callback (AudioCallback)
//   AttachAudioStreamProcessor: takes a C callback (AudioCallback)
//   DetachAudioStreamProcessor: takes a C callback (AudioCallback)
//   AttachAudioMixedProcessor: takes a C callback (AudioCallback)
//   DetachAudioMixedProcessor: takes a C callback (AudioCallback)
